WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.168
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:05.839
M's, having advanced to the final preliminaries,
were invited to perform a concert at an event.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:08.216
Maki-chan, we need to focus on impact now!

00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:11.177
But because we got so
caught up A-RISE,

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.805
all of our attempts at trying
something new got us nowhere.

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:16.349
Come see the new face of J's!

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.643
We weren't just playing around!

00:00:18.643 --> 00:00:20.145
It's no wonder this happened.

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:24.190
However, we realized we're
most unique the way we are.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.192
That's what I like about p's.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:30.030
Meanwhile, something else was happening...

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:33.450
I had no idea it had gone this far.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:35.327
This looks bad.

00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:40.081
It's more than just bad. We're too late!

00:00:40.081 --> 00:00:41.666
Mom, no!

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:43.168
Good morning!

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.045
- Honoka...
- Huh?

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:49.299
Ah, where did you find that
physical measurements form?

00:00:49.674 --> 00:00:52.427
It disappeared somewhere after I opened it.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:55.055
You still don't know?

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:57.390
Know what?

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:02.354
Height: 157 centimeters.

00:01:02.354 --> 00:01:03.730
That hasn't changed.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.649
And my weight...

00:01:12.113 --> 00:01:16.034
I've gotta do something about this.

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:22.248
Saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:29.839
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:01:36.888 --> 00:01:42.227
Tsuyoi tsuyoi negaigoto ga
A strong, strong wish

00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:47.774
bokutachi wo michibiite kureta
Led us along

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:52.862
tsugi wa zettai yuzurenaiyo
We can't give up the next one

00:01:52.862 --> 00:01:57.992
nokosareta jikan wo nigirishimete We'll hold
on tightly to the time we have remaining

00:01:57.992 --> 00:02:03.498
tada no omoide sore dake ja iyadayo
We don't want only a memory

00:02:03.498 --> 00:02:09.337
seiippai chikara no kagiri hashirunda
We'll run as hard as we can

00:02:09.337 --> 00:02:12.215
(CHANCE FOR ME CHANCE FOR YOU)
(Chance for me! Chance for you!)

00:02:12.215 --> 00:02:17.846
Saa yume wo dakishimetara ue wo muite
Come on... Embrace your dreams and look up

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:22.600
kimi no sekai ga ohkiku kawaruyo
Your world will change dramatically

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:28.732
saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:02:28.732 --> 00:02:33.778
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:02:33.778 --> 00:02:39.117
Ima koko de deaeta kiseki
The miracle that we met here and now

00:02:39.117 --> 00:02:45.832
wasurenaide bokutachi no kisetsu
Don't forget our season

00:02:48.251 --> 00:02:50.086
This proves you're slacking off!

00:02:50.086 --> 00:02:52.046
#7 - We Have to Do Something!
You've allowed all this paperwork to pile up.

00:02:52.422 --> 00:02:56.509
This is what happens when you're
careless with everything.

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:57.510
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:02:57.927 --> 00:03:02.474
But we exercise and sweat
SO much every day.

00:03:02.891 --> 00:03:07.103
I didn't think I gained this much weight...

00:03:07.103 --> 00:03:09.147
Your height hasn't changed?

00:03:09.147 --> 00:03:11.775
Nope. Yukiho was so mad at me.

00:03:11.775 --> 00:03:14.402
She said she'd never seen
an idol like me before.

00:03:14.402 --> 00:03:17.155
Is that onion consomme flavor?

00:03:17.155 --> 00:03:18.948
Yeah. It just came out.

00:03:18.948 --> 00:03:21.826
I've been wanting to try it. Gimme a bite!

00:03:22.952 --> 00:03:25.163
Have you forgotten what Yukiho said?

00:03:25.163 --> 00:03:28.541
It'll be fine. I cut down on my breakfast today.

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:29.834
Look! I was even running just now!

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:35.298
It seems you need a dose of reality.

00:03:35.715 --> 00:03:36.341
Huh?

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:38.259
Reality?

00:03:39.427 --> 00:03:41.513
The outfit from our first concert?

00:03:42.597 --> 00:03:43.598
Why?

00:03:43.598 --> 00:03:47.060
Just shut up and put it on.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.144
What?

00:03:51.022 --> 00:03:55.401
If I'm right, this should
make it perfectly clear...

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:58.780
...what has happened to Honoka's body.

00:03:59.989 --> 00:04:02.450
To Honoka-chan's body...

00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:11.793
Honoka-chan, are you okay?

00:04:11.793 --> 00:04:13.211
Sorry, girls.

00:04:13.211 --> 00:04:15.046
I want to be alone today.

00:04:15.046 --> 00:04:16.631
D-Don't worry about it.

00:04:16.631 --> 00:04:20.051
You may have gained weight,
but you don't look that different—

00:04:20.051 --> 00:04:20.885
Really!?

00:04:21.803 --> 00:04:23.137
Um...

00:04:23.137 --> 00:04:25.765
Consoling her won't do her any good.

00:04:25.765 --> 00:04:27.267
Didn't you just look in the mirror?

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:32.689
You saw, didn't you?

00:04:34.232 --> 00:04:36.651
Stop!

00:04:36.651 --> 00:04:40.405
Gaining weight diminishes your
appearance and movements,

00:04:40.405 --> 00:04:42.824
which will affect your performance.

00:04:42.824 --> 00:04:44.534
Not to mention, you're our leader, Honoka.

00:04:46.244 --> 00:04:49.372
You'll have to go on a diet
to prepare for Love Live!

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:51.875
The autumn harvest!

00:04:51.875 --> 00:04:55.336
Fall is the season for harvesting rice.

00:04:55.336 --> 00:04:58.047
That thing sure is big.

00:04:58.047 --> 00:05:00.967
Don't tell me you're going to eat that yourself?

00:05:00.967 --> 00:05:02.510
It's fresh rice.

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:07.515
I need at least this much to experience the
piping hot goodness and lustrous flavor.

00:05:10.059 --> 00:05:12.061
That looks good...

00:05:12.061 --> 00:05:13.021
Do you want some?

00:05:13.771 --> 00:05:14.647
Really?

00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:15.690
No!

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:21.279
Do you have any idea what it'll
take to burn off all those carbs?

00:05:22.113 --> 00:05:23.448
What's wrong?

00:05:23.448 --> 00:05:25.033
Are you on a diet?

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:29.871
Yeah. I need to lose weight
by the final preliminaries...

00:05:31.789 --> 00:05:38.838
That sounds rough. What a shame to be on
a diet during new rice season. Poor thing...

00:05:38.838 --> 00:05:40.798
Let's get back to your diet.

00:05:40.798 --> 00:05:42.342
You're so mean, Umi-chan!

00:05:42.342 --> 00:05:43.551
We don't have a choice.

00:05:43.551 --> 00:05:48.473
It's unfortunate, but as our leader,
you have to keep yourself in shape.

00:05:49.098 --> 00:05:53.937
Besides, I'm sure your diet will be more
effective with the help of the other members.

00:05:55.438 --> 00:05:59.317
That's true, but we'll have longer practices...

00:05:59.317 --> 00:06:02.528
You have to eat a lot in order
to keep your energy up.

00:06:02.862 --> 00:06:04.656
Don't worry about that.

00:06:04.656 --> 00:06:07.992
I'll prepare a menu for you.

00:06:08.368 --> 00:06:10.662
I won't push you too hard.

00:06:10.662 --> 00:06:13.373
But not being able to eat when you want to...

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:20.630
Kayo-chin...

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:21.464
Huh?

00:06:21.464 --> 00:06:25.802
I thought it was just my
imagination, but have you...?

00:06:32.976 --> 00:06:36.145
I had no idea it had gotten this bad...

00:06:37.355 --> 00:06:42.568
It could just be that they're growing girls...

00:06:42.568 --> 00:06:44.737
But it's at a point where
it can't be ignored, right?

00:06:48.074 --> 00:06:50.743
"Cut to the Limit Diet Plan" - Umi
Sonoda Starting today, this is your menu.

00:06:50.743 --> 00:06:52.954
What!? This is all we get for dinner?

00:06:52.954 --> 00:06:54.580
M-My rice...

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:58.668
Eating large dinners makes you gain weight.

00:06:59.836 --> 00:07:03.756
But don't worry. You can
eat a solid breakfast.

00:07:05.591 --> 00:07:08.302
We just have to do our best, Honoka-chan.

00:07:08.302 --> 00:07:09.262
You're right.

00:07:10.304 --> 00:07:11.347
I'm glad, though.

00:07:15.309 --> 00:07:19.772
I've got a friend who's in
the same boat as me.

00:07:23.985 --> 00:07:25.570
A friend?

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.739
Did you just look away?

00:07:27.739 --> 00:07:31.200
Excuse me... Are you taking a break?

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:34.370
Could we get your autographs?

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:37.040
Huh? Who are you?

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.833
Oh, sorry.

00:07:38.833 --> 00:07:43.004
We were moved by your Halloween concert.

00:07:43.004 --> 00:07:45.465
Thank you. I'm glad to hear that.

00:07:45.465 --> 00:07:46.758
Honoka, what do you think?

00:07:47.216 --> 00:07:50.261
Of course! We'd be happy to do it.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:54.265
Thank you so much!

00:07:54.265 --> 00:07:58.519
I actually wish I had Sonoda-senpai's body.

00:07:58.519 --> 00:08:01.147
M-My body isn't that nice.

00:08:01.147 --> 00:08:05.026
I think Kotori-senpai's slim figure is beautiful.

00:08:05.026 --> 00:08:07.403
I'm not slim at all.

00:08:07.403 --> 00:08:09.113
I like Honoka-senpai's...

00:08:09.113 --> 00:08:09.697
My...?

00:08:11.616 --> 00:08:14.035
...energetic spirit.

00:08:14.035 --> 00:08:16.037
Th-Thanks...

00:08:18.456 --> 00:08:20.958
So everyone's thinking the same thing.

00:08:20.958 --> 00:08:24.337
That's not true. It was just a coincidence.

00:08:24.337 --> 00:08:27.215
I'm sure you're even more motivated now.

00:08:27.215 --> 00:08:30.927
Humans aren't that simple.

00:08:35.807 --> 00:08:37.391
What is this!?

00:08:37.391 --> 00:08:39.852
The budget meeting is coming up.

00:08:39.852 --> 00:08:42.772
We've collected budget
requests from every club.

00:08:44.315 --> 00:08:47.527
Kotori and I will handle these.

00:08:47.527 --> 00:08:50.488
Honoka, why don't you start
by taking care of all of those?

00:08:52.198 --> 00:08:53.574
All of these?

00:08:54.117 --> 00:08:56.202
Um, excuse me.

00:08:56.202 --> 00:08:57.995
I'm from the Art Club.

00:08:58.913 --> 00:09:04.001
I thought it'd be better to turn this in sooner,
so I brought my budget request in person.

00:09:04.001 --> 00:09:06.170
Oh, thank you.

00:09:08.005 --> 00:09:11.968
Looks good. Thank you very much.

00:09:11.968 --> 00:09:13.886
Thank you.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:16.222
Here, Kotori.

00:09:16.222 --> 00:09:16.889
Okay.

00:09:17.932 --> 00:09:20.852
Approved

00:09:24.063 --> 00:09:25.648
Wow!

00:09:25.648 --> 00:09:28.067
It has so many views.

00:09:28.067 --> 00:09:30.695
"A formidable rival for A-RISE has appeared."

00:09:30.695 --> 00:09:33.364
"Don't miss them in the final round."

00:09:34.073 --> 00:09:39.287
Looks like we were right to
stick with our own style.

00:09:39.287 --> 00:09:42.832
All right! Let's make it through
the final preliminaries, too!

00:09:44.125 --> 00:09:47.962
Those two need to get it together by then.

00:09:56.762 --> 00:09:58.890
Wh-What is this?

00:09:59.599 --> 00:10:03.895
Have those stairs always
been that hard to climb?

00:10:04.729 --> 00:10:10.151
You're practically running with weights
attached to your bodies. Of course it's hard.

00:10:10.151 --> 00:10:13.571
All right. Let's jump right
into a five kilometer run.

00:10:13.571 --> 00:10:14.447
What?

00:10:14.864 --> 00:10:16.324
Hurry up and go!

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:20.244
What are you doing? Quickly, now.

00:10:22.163 --> 00:10:24.415
You're so mean, Umi-chan!

00:10:40.765 --> 00:10:49.106
Rice Restaurant

00:10:51.525 --> 00:10:53.319
Free Large Serving of Rice!

00:11:23.933 --> 00:11:26.852
Golden Rice

00:11:39.448 --> 00:11:41.242
See you later!

00:11:41.242 --> 00:11:42.952
Let's go, Hanayo-chan!

00:11:42.952 --> 00:11:44.203
Yeah!

00:11:44.203 --> 00:11:46.247
They're working so hard.

00:11:46.247 --> 00:11:48.666
Their diet seems to be
coming along well, too.

00:11:49.166 --> 00:11:50.793
You really think so?

00:11:51.711 --> 00:11:57.675
They seem oddly positive
about running this week.

00:11:57.675 --> 00:11:59.719
You're probably just imagining things.

00:12:00.344 --> 00:12:02.221
I'm going to go check on them.

00:12:02.221 --> 00:12:04.307
Thank you very much.

00:12:05.349 --> 00:12:08.602
Free Large Serving of Rice! Delicious
Rice That was delicious again today!

00:12:08.602 --> 00:12:11.355
Look, look! We filled our stamp card today!

00:12:11.772 --> 00:12:12.523
Really?

00:12:12.523 --> 00:12:15.067
Now our next large serving
of rice will be free!

00:12:15.067 --> 00:12:18.237
A free large serving of rice!? Am I in heaven!?

00:12:18.237 --> 00:12:19.697
Right? Right?

00:12:21.073 --> 00:12:22.658
You girls...

00:12:30.624 --> 00:12:33.544
Why don't you explain yourselves?

00:12:35.254 --> 00:12:36.630
Love Live!

00:12:38.257 --> 00:12:42.428
I will now announce the
current progress of your diet.

00:12:42.428 --> 00:12:43.054
Okay.

00:12:43.471 --> 00:12:44.722
First, Hanayo.

00:12:44.722 --> 00:12:46.432
Your exercise has paid off.

00:12:46.432 --> 00:12:48.642
You've managed to return
to your former weight.

00:12:48.642 --> 00:12:49.935
Really!?

00:12:49.935 --> 00:12:50.936
However, Honoka...

00:12:50.936 --> 00:12:51.645
Yes!

00:12:51.645 --> 00:12:53.606
Your weight hasn't changed.

00:12:53.606 --> 00:12:55.858
What!? No way!

00:12:55.858 --> 00:12:58.152
I could say the same thing.

00:12:58.152 --> 00:13:00.738
Are you actually following
your training regimen?

00:13:01.113 --> 00:13:04.325
I am. I run... I do pushups...

00:13:04.325 --> 00:13:08.621
Someone witnessed you receiving
snacks from Kotori yesterday.

00:13:08.621 --> 00:13:11.040
What? It was just one bite.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:15.252
According to Yukiho, you even
ate dango at home yesterday.

00:13:15.252 --> 00:13:19.465
My dad came up with a new product
and wanted me to try it.

00:13:19.465 --> 00:13:20.925
What about the cake after that?

00:13:20.925 --> 00:13:23.177
Someone gave it to my mom.

00:13:23.677 --> 00:13:25.596
It would've gone bad if someone didn't eat it!

00:13:25.596 --> 00:13:27.181
That's not the point...

00:13:27.181 --> 00:13:29.141
What are you thinking?

00:13:29.141 --> 00:13:31.227
You're the leader of J's!

00:13:31.227 --> 00:13:33.396
Yeah, but...

00:13:33.396 --> 00:13:36.273
Do you really want to perform at Love Live!?

00:13:36.273 --> 00:13:37.566
Of course I do!

00:13:37.566 --> 00:13:39.151
It doesn't look that way to me!

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:42.238
I feel bad for Honoka-chan.

00:13:42.238 --> 00:13:46.367
Umi is always especially hard on her.

00:13:46.367 --> 00:13:49.120
Maybe she doesn't like Honoka-chan.

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:50.788
No.

00:13:51.956 --> 00:13:53.541
She loves her.

00:13:53.541 --> 00:13:54.375
Honoka!

00:13:54.375 --> 00:13:57.920
Why are you always like this!?

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:01.215
I don't enjoy yelling at you!

00:14:01.215 --> 00:14:03.717
- You're making me look awful!
- It doesn't look that way to me.

00:14:03.717 --> 00:14:04.593
Excuse me...

00:14:05.761 --> 00:14:06.637
What's up?

00:14:07.847 --> 00:14:09.181
Well...

00:14:09.807 --> 00:14:11.809
What!? It was approved?

00:14:11.809 --> 00:14:15.062
Yeah. The Art Club seemed happy.

00:14:15.062 --> 00:14:18.315
Their request was approved
before the budget meeting.

00:14:18.315 --> 00:14:19.900
That's impossible.

00:14:20.359 --> 00:14:22.570
Their request can't be
approved before the meeting.

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:26.198
Kotori-chan?

00:14:27.616 --> 00:14:29.618
Budget Approval Application
Approved

00:14:29.618 --> 00:14:30.494
Why!?

00:14:30.494 --> 00:14:32.371
How was their request approved?

00:14:32.746 --> 00:14:36.208
I think I... At that moment...

00:14:37.501 --> 00:14:41.172
Approved

00:14:41.964 --> 00:14:43.174
I'm sorry.

00:14:44.383 --> 00:14:46.469
Let's go talk to the Art Club.

00:14:46.469 --> 00:14:49.805
What!? Telling me this now
puts me in a bad spot...

00:14:49.805 --> 00:14:51.765
Didn't you approve our request?

00:14:51.765 --> 00:14:55.060
Yes, but that was a mistake.

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:58.147
Then you should've told me, then.

00:14:58.147 --> 00:14:59.857
I already told everyone.

00:15:00.274 --> 00:15:02.860
I can't tell them it wasn't approved now.

00:15:04.945 --> 00:15:06.906
This has become quite a problem.

00:15:06.906 --> 00:15:08.782
I'm sorry.

00:15:08.782 --> 00:15:11.160
I thought we were being careful.

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:13.829
It's not your fault. I...

00:15:14.246 --> 00:15:17.082
No, it's my fault.

00:15:17.082 --> 00:15:21.045
I let my work pile up, and put it on you two.

00:15:21.045 --> 00:15:25.799
We'll talk about that later. Right now, we
have to do something about the budget.

00:15:25.799 --> 00:15:29.345
I know a former member of the Art Club.

00:15:29.345 --> 00:15:31.263
I'll talk to her.

00:15:31.263 --> 00:15:32.097
Good idea.

00:15:32.598 --> 00:15:36.936
She might be willing to help the
former student council president.

00:15:36.936 --> 00:15:38.270
Thank you.

00:15:40.898 --> 00:15:41.857
But...

00:15:43.526 --> 00:15:47.321
...shouldn't we handle this ourselves?

00:15:47.321 --> 00:15:48.739
Honoka-chan.

00:15:48.739 --> 00:15:50.950
It was our mistake.

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:52.576
We'll handle it.

00:15:53.327 --> 00:15:56.455
We're the student council now.

00:15:57.248 --> 00:15:58.332
But—

00:15:59.667 --> 00:16:00.834
Nozomi?

00:16:12.346 --> 00:16:13.681
Are you worried about them?

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:17.226
Huh? Well...

00:16:17.226 --> 00:16:19.520
Why don't we get some
parfaits on the way home?

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:20.396
What?

00:16:20.396 --> 00:16:24.567
The three of them will have to
handle it once we graduate.

00:16:25.192 --> 00:16:26.026
Let's go.

00:16:33.033 --> 00:16:34.535
That should do it.

00:16:35.077 --> 00:16:37.496
You're finished? Wow!

00:16:39.456 --> 00:16:41.000
I feel refreshed!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.793
I'll help you with the budget.

00:16:42.793 --> 00:16:43.961
What should I do?

00:16:43.961 --> 00:16:47.715
For crying out loud...
You can actually do it if you just focus.

00:16:47.715 --> 00:16:50.843
Why can't you just do a little every day?

00:16:50.843 --> 00:16:54.638
Yeah. I know, but...

00:16:54.638 --> 00:16:59.518
Well, if you could do that,
I wouldn't have anything to do.

00:17:03.147 --> 00:17:04.064
Yeah, yeah.

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:10.279
Hey, hurry up and go—

00:17:12.072 --> 00:17:13.741
Umi-chan, how are yours going?

00:17:13.741 --> 00:17:15.492
The calculations matched just now.

00:17:16.118 --> 00:17:18.287
I'll be done with this one soon, too.

00:17:18.287 --> 00:17:20.664
Okay, time for the final spurt!

00:17:30.507 --> 00:17:33.302
The budget meeting's finally happening.

00:17:33.802 --> 00:17:36.472
I hope it goes well...

00:17:47.191 --> 00:17:48.859
The atmosphere's so heavy in here.

00:17:49.693 --> 00:17:52.946
Nico-chan? What are you doing here?

00:17:52.946 --> 00:17:54.657
Isn't it obvious?

00:17:54.657 --> 00:17:57.368
I'm the president of the Idol Study Club.

00:17:57.368 --> 00:17:58.827
Oh, right.

00:17:59.286 --> 00:18:01.830
Anyway, I'm sure you know
what I'm going to say.

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:03.791
We need an increase in our budget.

00:18:03.791 --> 00:18:05.584
Nico-chan.

00:18:05.584 --> 00:18:07.127
We'll do our best.

00:18:07.628 --> 00:18:09.755
Honoka, we should get started.

00:18:09.755 --> 00:18:12.216
Huh? Oh.

00:18:12.216 --> 00:18:17.846
Now that all of the club representatives
are here, let's begin the budget meeting.

00:18:17.846 --> 00:18:19.723
I'd like to start by saying—

00:18:19.723 --> 00:18:20.724
Excuse me.

00:18:20.724 --> 00:18:24.395
First, could you explain what's
going on with the Art Club?

00:18:25.187 --> 00:18:25.896
Huh?

00:18:29.149 --> 00:18:30.359
Um...

00:18:30.359 --> 00:18:31.485
Well...

00:18:32.069 --> 00:18:33.821
You can't spend what you don't have.

00:18:35.406 --> 00:18:36.281
What?

00:18:36.281 --> 00:18:38.075
Uh...Honoka-chan?

00:18:38.075 --> 00:18:39.952
What are you talking about?

00:18:39.952 --> 00:18:41.620
Huh? Was that not good?

00:18:42.329 --> 00:18:44.790
Allow me to explain, then.

00:18:46.625 --> 00:18:51.338
In regards to the Art Club's budget, it was
completely the student council's mistake.

00:18:51.338 --> 00:18:55.551
We approved the request by accidentally
placing it in the box for approved documents.

00:18:55.551 --> 00:18:57.511
We have no excuse for that.

00:18:57.886 --> 00:19:01.265
However, I don't believe budget requests

00:19:01.265 --> 00:19:03.767
should be approved before
the budget meeting.

00:19:04.268 --> 00:19:08.188
With our apologies, we'd like
to revoke our approval.

00:19:09.022 --> 00:19:10.816
Now, about the budget.

00:19:11.316 --> 00:19:16.113
Otonokizaka High escaped
closure for this year.

00:19:16.113 --> 00:19:20.617
The reality is, there are fewer students
now than there were last year.

00:19:20.617 --> 00:19:25.998
The student council has taken
the liberty of drafting a budget.

00:19:25.998 --> 00:19:28.167
Vice President, could you explain?

00:19:28.167 --> 00:19:29.126
Huh?

00:19:32.546 --> 00:19:34.465
They drafted a budget...

00:19:34.465 --> 00:19:35.799
Come to think of it,

00:19:35.799 --> 00:19:38.677
I noticed the lights in the student council
room have been on pretty late recently.

00:19:38.677 --> 00:19:42.097
U-Um, based on each club's
budgets from previous years

00:19:42.097 --> 00:19:46.769
and your requests for this year,
we created a tentative budget.

00:19:47.227 --> 00:19:50.147
No club will receive the
total amount they requested,

00:19:50.147 --> 00:19:53.525
but this should give you at least
80% of your desired amounts.

00:19:54.109 --> 00:20:00.157
With this budget, each club should have
no problem operating for the next year.

00:20:00.157 --> 00:20:04.328
We ask that you trust that the
student body will grow next year,

00:20:05.412 --> 00:20:07.790
and for your understanding this year.

00:20:16.632 --> 00:20:19.760
As the student council, we did our best.

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:21.929
We know it's not perfect.

00:20:22.387 --> 00:20:23.764
But please...

00:20:23.764 --> 00:20:25.599
Please accept this budget!

00:20:25.974 --> 00:20:27.601
Please!

00:20:36.068 --> 00:20:38.070
All those in favor of the proposed budget.

00:20:55.128 --> 00:20:57.214
You passed the budget like that!?

00:20:57.214 --> 00:20:59.508
It was really close.

00:20:59.508 --> 00:21:01.760
But I'm glad it went well.

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.637
It's all thanks to me.
You should be grateful for—

00:21:03.637 --> 00:21:05.931
- Thanks, Nico-chan!
- Forget about that!

00:21:05.931 --> 00:21:07.474
Anyway, the Idol Study Club's budget—

00:21:07.474 --> 00:21:09.351
We need to talk about your diet first.

00:21:09.351 --> 00:21:12.145
I just weighed myself, and I'm back to normal.

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:14.982
Really?

00:21:14.982 --> 00:21:15.816
Yeah.

00:21:15.816 --> 00:21:19.486
Because we were working
so hard, I forgot to eat.

00:21:19.486 --> 00:21:21.238
You're so simple.

00:21:23.782 --> 00:21:25.284
Maki-chan.

00:21:25.284 --> 00:21:26.910
You were right, Kotori.

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:28.161
What?

00:21:28.161 --> 00:21:31.290
The three of you trust each other.

00:21:32.708 --> 00:21:33.625
Yeah.

00:21:33.625 --> 00:21:37.671
- We talk about the good and bad together.
- The bread tastes delicious again today!

00:21:37.671 --> 00:21:40.173
- That's why we're able to grow little by little.
- There you go eating bread again!

00:21:40.173 --> 00:21:42.843
Why can't I? My weight's back to normal!

00:21:42.843 --> 00:21:44.136
Because you can't!

00:21:44.136 --> 00:21:46.346
Umi-chan, have some with me!

00:21:46.346 --> 00:21:48.223
No! Give that to me!

00:21:48.223 --> 00:21:50.017
No way!

00:21:50.017 --> 00:21:52.185
Wait!

00:21:52.185 --> 00:21:54.938
The student council seems fine.

00:21:54.938 --> 00:21:55.814
Yeah.

00:22:08.285 --> 00:22:10.120
Do you want to get parfaits again today?

00:22:13.415 --> 00:22:14.541
Sure.

00:22:15.083 --> 00:22:20.923
Ureshiikara kimi ni ai ni ikou
Because I'm happy, I'll go see you

00:22:20.923 --> 00:22:26.637
sabishiikara kimi ni ai ni ikou (ai ni ikuyo)
Because I'm lonely, I'll go see you (I'll go see you)

00:22:27.054 --> 00:22:29.932
Sonna kimochi ni narunda
That's how I feel

00:22:29.932 --> 00:22:32.935
susumu toki nayamu toki Whether I'm
making progress or hung up on something,

00:22:32.935 --> 00:22:36.897
tsunagatteirundane zutto
We're always connected

00:22:38.398 --> 00:22:44.071
<i>honki no yume de (HI LETS GO) asu wo tsukamu (HI GO GO) With
a true dream, (Hi! Let's go') seize tomorrow (Hi' Go, go')</i>

00:22:44.071 --> 00:22:51.495
Kitto dekiruyo kimi nara
I'm sure you can do it

00:22:53.914 --> 00:22:59.753
tama ni wa yukkuri kimi no pehsu de
Sometimes, take your time at your own pace

00:22:59.753 --> 00:23:05.592
yaritai kototachi mitsumetegoran
To look at all the things you want to do

00:23:05.592 --> 00:23:12.641
sono ato ganbare zenryokudene (ganbarouyo) Then do
your best! With all your strength (Let's do our best)

00:23:12.641 --> 00:23:21.692
Kibun ga harete ohzora e maiagaruyo Once you've
cleared your head, you'll fly up into the sky

00:23:22.234 --> 00:23:32.619
donna toki datte kimi wo mitsumeteru
I'm always looking at you

00:23:35.956 --> 00:23:38.875
Next time on Love Live!
"My Wish"
